brand,dimension,claim,source_type,source_name,url,capture_date,evidence_excerpt,confidence,notes
"MITH Bangkok","brand_architecture","MITH defines itself as 'Made in Thailand' and ties the name to friendship/good fragrance.","official_website","MITH Bangkok About Us","https://mithbangkok.com/about-us/","2026-05-25","About page states MITH is the abbreviation for made in thailand and that 'mith' in Thai means friend or friendship.","high","EV-01"
"MITH Bangkok","product_portfolio","MITH operates a large DTC catalog rather than a tight capsule assortment.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Shop","https://mithbangkok.com/shop/","2026-05-25","Shop page shows 'Showing 1-12 of 161 results'.","high","EV-02"
"MITH Bangkok","product_portfolio","MITH spans fragrance plus home fragrance, body care, and inhaler categories.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Shop","https://mithbangkok.com/shop/","2026-05-25","Product categories include fragrances, home fragrances, body care, and inhaler.","high","EV-03"
"MITH Bangkok","price_ladder","MITH uses an accessible ladder from entry mini sizes to higher full-bottle prices.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Home","https://mithbangkok.com/","2026-05-25","Home page shows Lemon Ice Tea and Thai Pomelo at 399-1,159 THB, Legend at 699-2,059 THB, and Nude at 699-2,859 THB.","high","EV-04"
"MITH Bangkok","retail_channels","MITH has broad physical distribution across Bangkok and upcountry malls.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Contact Us","https://mithbangkok.com/contact-us/","2026-05-25","Branches listed include Central World, Central Ladprao, Mega Bangna, Central Westgate, Chiang Mai, Fashion Island, Rama 9, Bangkapi, Siam, and more.","high","EV-05"
"MITH Bangkok","olfactory_positioning","Nude is positioned as a hero musky skin-scent with an external star perfumer credit.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Nude Product Page","https://mithbangkok.com/product/nude/","2026-05-25","Nude is marked HOT, offered in 15ml/60ml/100ml, credits Quentin Bisch, and describes a universal soft skin-scent profile.","high","EV-06"
"MITH Bangkok","olfactory_positioning","MITH's fragrance taxonomy covers familiar wearable families with a few concept collections.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Shop","https://mithbangkok.com/shop/","2026-05-25","Fragrance filters include Tea, Gourmand, Musky, Citrus, Floral, Woody, Oud, The Four Seasons, and One Fine Day.","high","EV-07"
"MITH Bangkok","campaigns_collabs","MITH leverages a large roster of well-known perfumer collaborations as a credibility signal.","fragrance_database","Fragrantica Designer Page","https://www.fragrantica.com/designers/Mith.html","2026-05-25","Fragrantica lists collaborations with Quentin Bisch, Carlos Benaim, Fabrice Pellegrin, Nathalie Lorson, Anne Flipo, and many others.","medium","EV-08"
"MITH Bangkok","customer_signal","Travel shoppers describe MITH as a destination stop in Bangkok's mall perfume circuit.","social_review","Reddit r/fragheadph","https://www.reddit.com/r/fragheadph/comments/1mqteop/mith_bangkok/","2026-05-25","Post recommends dropping into a MITH boutique in a mall near you and frames the store as a Bangkok fragrance stop.","medium","EV-09"
"MITH Bangkok","customer_signal","MITH has strong awareness but also at least one recent service complaint tied to in-store experience.","social_review","Reddit r/fragrance","https://www.reddit.com/r/fragrance/comments/1s8wxrd/perfume_shopping_experience_in_thailand/","2026-05-25","Recent shopper says MITH's name keeps popping up, but reports a negative judged-by-appearance counter experience at CentralWorld.","medium","EV-10"
"MITH Bangkok","product_portfolio","External fragrance databases show a fast release tempo and a broad perfume-only archive since 2020.","fragrance_database","Fragrantica Designer Page","https://www.fragrantica.com/designers/Mith.html","2026-05-25","Designer page lists numerous launches from Peach Please 2020 through multiple 2025-2026 releases.","medium","EV-11"
"MITH Bangkok","price_ladder","Core EDP pricing still reaches upper-middle Thai premium territory without leaving local-accessible range.","official_website","MITH Bangkok Shop","https://mithbangkok.com/shop/","2026-05-25","Another Tea is shown at 1,859-2,659 THB, below most imported niche pricing but above mini-entry price points.","high","EV-12"
"MITH Bangkok","digital_presence","MITH supports DTC with multiple contact channels beyond the website.","official_website","MITH Bangkok About Us","https://mithbangkok.com/about-us/","2026-05-25","About page lists Line ID @mithbangkok, Facebook, WeChat ID mith-official, email, and site navigation into categories/blog/contact.","high","EV-13"
"MITH Bangkok","customer_signal","Thai marketplace signal suggests meaningful volume and repeatability on core perfume and home-scent SKUs.","marketplace","Shopee Thailand - Mith Bangkok Official Store","https://shopee.co.th/mith_bangkok","2026-05-25","Official store shows 63.3k followers, 4.9 rating, Blue Wood sold 3k+ units, Reed Diffuser sold 3k+ units, and several perfume SKUs with 100+ to 1k+ sales.","high","EV-29"
"MITH Bangkok","product_portfolio","Thai beauty media reinforces MITH's local-brand accessibility and sample-size strategy.","thai_beauty_media","Cosmenet - 10 Thai Perfume Brands","https://www.cosmenet.in.th/cosme-intrend/54718","2026-05-25","Cosmenet describes MITH as elegant but not overpriced and notes that trial sizes are available across multiple scents.","medium","EV-30"
"VIBES LAB","brand_architecture","VIBES LAB frames itself around aromachology, memory, and emotion rather than standard perfumery language.","official_website","VIBES LAB About Us","https://vibeslab.co/pages/about-us","2026-05-25","About page says 'a single scent is worth a thousand memories' and describes the power of aromachology to trigger emotion and tell stories.","high","EV-14"
"VIBES LAB","olfactory_positioning","VIBES LAB centers on uncommon addictive scent ideas rather than classical perfumery families.","official_website","VIBES LAB About Us","https://vibeslab.co/pages/about-us","2026-05-25","Brand states its obsession is 'the uncommon things people find strangely addictive' such as money, gasoline, or a new car.","high","EV-15"
"VIBES LAB","product_portfolio","The consumer perfume line is curated rather than broad.","official_website","VIBES LAB Eau de Parfum Collection","https://vibeslab.co/collections/eau-de-perfumes","2026-05-25","EDP collection page shows 13 products.","high","EV-16"
"VIBES LAB","price_ladder","VIBES LAB sits in a tighter premium perfume band than MITH.","official_website","VIBES LAB Eau de Parfum Collection","https://vibeslab.co/collections/eau-de-perfumes","2026-05-25","EDP collection listings are shown as 'From 2,900 THB'.","high","EV-17"
"VIBES LAB","product_portfolio","VIBES LAB extends perfume concepts into a home-scent ecosystem.","official_website","VIBES LAB Home","https://vibeslab.co/","2026-05-25","Top navigation and homepage sections include Eau de Parfum, Reed Diffuser, Interior Spray, and Candle.","high","EV-18"
"VIBES LAB","retail_channels","VIBES LAB has selective premium Bangkok retail instead of a large mall network.","official_website","VIBES LAB Stores","https://vibeslab.co/pages/stores","2026-05-25","Stores page lists EMSPHERE, Gaysorn Amarin, and VIBES LAB Headquarters.","high","EV-19"
"VIBES LAB","commercial_model","VIBES LAB explicitly sells scent branding as a business service.","official_website","VIBES LAB Business","https://vibeslab.co/pages/business","2026-05-25","Business page defines scent branding as crafting a signature scent tied to a brand to create emotional bonds with consumers.","high","EV-20"
"VIBES LAB","strategic_moat","VIBES LAB's B2B offer includes subscription, custom scent creation, customer journey design, and brand audit.","press","ELLE Thailand - Vibes Lab Founder Feature","https://ellethailand.com/vibes-lab/","2026-05-25","ELLE describes a full-service subscription model for business clients including custom scent creation, customer journey design, brand audit, and back-end service.","medium","EV-21"
"VIBES LAB","campaigns_collabs","VIBES LAB has blue-chip Thai and multinational client references that function like collaboration proof.","press","Tatler Asia - Personalized Perfume Services","https://www.tatlerasia.com/style/beauty/where-to-try-personalized-perfume-services-th","2026-05-25","Tatler says Vibes Lab works with Owndays, Mercedes-Benz, Holiday Inn, Sindhorn Kempinski, AP Thai, Ananda Development, RAKxa Wellness, and Tim Hortons.","medium","EV-22"
"VIBES LAB","olfactory_positioning","The perfume line is sold as unusual, molecule-aware, rarity-driven niche scenting.","press","ELLE Thailand - VIBES LAB PARFUMS","https://ellethailand.com/vibes-lab-parfums/","2026-05-25","ELLE says the brand sees itself as aromachologist more than perfumer, uses rare ingredients plus aromatic molecules, and built 12 scents around uncommon addictive ideas.","medium","EV-23"
"VIBES LAB","retail_channels","VIBES LAB supports selective offline retail with online marketplace and messaging channels.","press","ELLE Thailand - VIBES LAB PARFUMS","https://ellethailand.com/vibes-lab-parfums/","2026-05-25","ELLE says consumers can try the line at Gaysorn Amarin 2F and shop via Lazada and Line Official @Vibeslab.","medium","EV-24"
"VIBES LAB","product_portfolio","Home-scent pricing is standardized and supports gifting / environment-scenting use cases.","official_website","VIBES LAB Home","https://vibeslab.co/","2026-05-25","Homepage shows reed diffusers at 1,290 THB, interior sprays at 1,290 THB, and candles at 2,290 THB.","high","EV-25"
